<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#d1e5f3">Come on!</font></b></font></font>

5
00:00:16,330 --> 00:00:20,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#d1e5f3">owareru youni</font></b></font></font>

6
00:00:16,330 --> 00:00:20,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#d1e5f3">Running like a fugitive,</font></b></font></font>

7
00:00:20,210 --> 00:00:22,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#d1e5f3">isoi de iru</font></b></font></font>

8
00:00:20,210 --> 00:00:22,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#d1e5f3">being chased by something.</font></b></font></font>

9
00:00:22,170 --> 00:00:27,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#d1e5f3">kawai ta mune ga</font></b></font></font>

10
00:00:22,170 --> 00:00:27,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#d1e5f3">Inside my heart is pounding,</font></b></font></font>

11
00:00:27,840 --> 00:00:30,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#d1e5f3">kari tateru no sa</font></b></font></font>

12
00:00:27,840 --> 00:00:30,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#d1e5f3">my throat dry like it's withering.</font></b></font></font>

13
00:00:32,180 --> 00:00:35,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#eff4ef">dare no tame de naku</font></b></font></font>

14
00:00:32,180 --> 00:00:35,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#eff4ef">For no single one,</font></b></font></font>

15
00:00:35,970 --> 00:00:40,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#eff4ef">dare no mono de naku</font></b></font></font>

16
00:00:35,970 --> 00:00:40,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#eff4ef">to none does belong,</font></b></font></font>

17
00:00:40,430 --> 00:00:45,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#eff4ef">ore tachi no ima ga</font></b></font></font>

18
00:00:40,430 --> 00:00:45,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#eff4ef">this time is ours, right now...</font></b></font></font>

19
00:00:47,270 --> 00:00:53,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">itami hodoki kokoro hodoki kage o hodoki</font></b></font></font>

20
00:00:47,270 --> 00:00:53,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">Unraveling the pain, unraveling our hearts, unraveling shadows.</font></b></font></font>

21
00:00:55,060 --> 00:01:00,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">iki o tsunete hashiri nukero yami o saite</font></b></font></font>

22
00:00:55,060 --> 00:01:00,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">Stifling our breath, reaching for beyond, tearing through the dark.</font></b></font></font>

23
00:01:03,160 --> 00:01:10,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">tatakau koto mo aishi au koto mo</font></b></font></font>

24
00:01:03,160 --> 00:01:10,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">In fighting and in love.</font></b></font></font>

25
00:01:10,920 --> 00:01:13,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">owari wa shinai</font></b></font></font>

26
00:01:10,920 --> 00:01:13,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">To the distant light above,</font></b></font></font>

27
00:01:13,890 --> 00:01:16,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">ON THE WAY</font></b></font></font>

28
00:01:13,890 --> 00:01:16,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">yes, we are on the way!</font></b></font></font>

29
00:01:21,850 --> 00:01:28,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">I WANNA ROCKS mune ni ROCKS</font></b></font></font>

30
00:01:21,850 --> 00:01:28,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">I wanna rock... Rockin' my heart...</font></b></font></font>

31
00:01:42,830 --> 00:01:45,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto nii-chan and others are
out there fighting!</font>

32
00:01:47,870 --> 00:01:49,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We should be too!</font>

33
00:01:50,790 --> 00:01:56,840
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">A Tool Known as a Shinobi</font>

34
00:01:58,380 --> 00:01:59,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Old man!</font>

35
00:01:59,760 --> 00:02:01,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Old Man Giichi!</font>

36
00:02:01,260 --> 00:02:02,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please open up!</font>

37
00:02:04,270 --> 00:02:06,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's go to the bridge!</font>

38
00:02:06,100 --> 00:02:07,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we all do it together,</font>

39
00:02:07,810 --> 00:02:10,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we can beat Gato and
his men this time!</font>

40
00:02:15,820 --> 00:02:16,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Inari...</font>

41
00:02:17,530 --> 00:02:20,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I made up my mind not
to fight anymore.</font>

42
00:02:21,280 --> 00:02:22,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even your father...</font>

43
00:02:24,160 --> 00:02:26,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The man we called a hero...</font>

44
00:02:27,210 --> 00:02:28,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's not with us anymore.</font>

45
00:02:33,630 --> 00:02:37,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we were to fight,
many lives would be lost.</font>

46
00:02:38,510 --> 00:02:41,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't want lose something that's
special to me anymore.</font>

47
00:02:42,930 --> 00:02:46,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No one wants to regret again.</font>

48
00:02:58,530 --> 00:02:59,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I...</font>

49
00:02:59,740 --> 00:03:02,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't want to regret again, either.</font>

50
00:03:03,320 --> 00:03:05,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's why we must fight!</font>

51
00:03:06,410 --> 00:03:09,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A man should live
his life without regrets.</font>

52
00:03:13,170 --> 00:03:15,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I love Mommy and Grampa.</font>

53
00:03:15,340 --> 00:03:17,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And you too, Old Man Giichi!</font>

54
00:03:17,510 --> 00:03:19,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I love all the people here!</font>

55
00:03:25,890 --> 00:03:27,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I finally realized...</font>

56
00:03:28,730 --> 00:03:31,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nothing is accomplished if
I just cry all the time!</font>

57
00:03:32,600 --> 00:03:34,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I finally got it!</font>

58
00:03:52,620 --> 00:03:57,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Inari... has grown into
a fine man.</font>

59
00:03:59,710 --> 00:04:03,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Will you just let Inari go
there by himself?</font>

60
00:04:10,310 --> 00:04:12,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Open up!
Hey!</font>

61
00:04:13,520 --> 00:04:15,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm asking you to fight with me!</font>

62
00:04:17,320 --> 00:04:19,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Old man! Please listen to me!</font>

63
00:04:25,780 --> 00:04:26,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why...</font>

64
00:04:27,410 --> 00:04:30,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why won't anyone open
the door to me?</font>

65
00:04:35,500 --> 00:04:37,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are strong!</font>

66
00:04:39,670 --> 00:04:41,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto nii-chan...</font>

67
00:05:00,440 --> 00:05:01,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Zabuza.</font>

68
00:05:01,650 --> 00:05:03,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You were too full of yourself.</font>

69
00:05:04,530 --> 00:05:06,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're too ambitious for your own good.</font>

70
00:05:10,030 --> 00:05:14,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You assassinated the Mizukage,
but failed to pull off a coup.</font>

71
00:05:15,540 --> 00:05:18,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You left the service with
few men under you,</font>

72
00:05:18,250 --> 00:05:20,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and became a Rogue Ninja.</font>

73
00:05:20,920 --> 00:05:25,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Soon after, your name reached
our Hidden Leaf Village.</font>

74
00:05:26,050 --> 00:05:28,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You needed to raise funds
to strike back.</font>

75
00:05:28,590 --> 00:05:29,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And you needed to hide</font>

76
00:05:30,010 --> 00:05:32,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">from the Tracking Unit's
pursuit and retaliation.</font>

77
00:05:32,890 --> 00:05:34,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Isn't that about the reason why</font>

78
00:05:34,560 --> 00:05:37,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you hired yourself out
to scum like Gato?</font>

79
00:05:39,020 --> 00:05:39,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Zabuza...</font>

80
00:05:40,020 --> 00:05:44,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you really believe I've managed
to survive with just Sharingan?</font>

81
00:05:45,650 --> 00:05:49,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here's something I didn't copy,
a technique of my own...</font>

82
00:05:51,530 --> 00:05:52,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to enlighten you!</font>

83
00:06:06,510 --> 00:06:07,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lightning Blade!</font>

84
00:06:09,090 --> 00:06:09,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What the...?!</font>

85
00:06:10,180 --> 00:06:13,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">His hand is...
visibly overflowing with Chakra!</font>

86
00:06:16,270 --> 00:06:18,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are too dangerous.</font>

87
00:06:18,980 --> 00:06:21,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tazuna-san, the man you are trying
to assassinate,</font>

88
00:06:21,730 --> 00:06:23,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is the symbol of courage
in this land!</font>

89
00:06:24,190 --> 00:06:27,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The bridge he is building
is the hope of this land!</font>

90
00:06:28,570 --> 00:06:31,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And your ambitions will
sacrifice countless lives.</font>

91
00:06:32,490 --> 00:06:36,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That isn't how
a Shinobi is supposed to behave.</font>

92
00:06:37,250 --> 00:06:38,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who cares?</font>

93
00:06:40,210 --> 00:06:43,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have always fought for
my own ideals.</font>

94
00:06:44,670 --> 00:06:48,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And that will never ever change!</font>

95
00:06:52,090 --> 00:06:53,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll say it again.</font>

96
00:06:54,010 --> 00:06:54,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

97
00:06:55,310 --> 00:06:56,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Give up.</font>

98
00:07:00,230 --> 00:07:02,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your future is... death!</font>

99
00:07:11,660 --> 00:07:12,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto-kun...</font>

100
00:07:13,280 --> 00:07:14,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want you to kill me.</font>

101
00:07:18,250 --> 00:07:19,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please, make it quick.</font>

102
00:07:24,710 --> 00:07:27,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you hesitating for?</font>

103
00:07:30,840 --> 00:07:32,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I just don't get it!</font>

104
00:07:32,840 --> 00:07:37,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The only reason you are allowed
to live is because you stay strong?</font>

105
00:07:40,890 --> 00:07:43,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There must be something other
than just fighting...</font>

106
00:07:43,230 --> 00:07:44,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There must be some other way</font>

107
00:07:44,480 --> 00:07:46,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">for you to make
the others accept you!</font>

108
00:07:48,400 --> 00:07:52,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Remember when we met at the forest?
Do you know what I thought?</font>

109
00:07:52,450 --> 00:07:54,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That you and I are much alike.</font>

110
00:07:57,580 --> 00:07:59,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sure you can relate to me.</font>

111
00:08:01,830 --> 00:08:05,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I apologize for dirtying
your hands with my blood.</font>

112
00:08:06,750 --> 00:08:07,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that it?</font>

113
00:08:09,050 --> 00:08:11,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is there really no other way?</font>

114
00:08:13,300 --> 00:08:14,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No.</font>

115
00:08:18,180 --> 00:08:21,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If only... we had met under
different circumstances,</font>

116
00:08:21,310 --> 00:08:23,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we could've been friends.</font>

117
00:08:30,280 --> 00:08:33,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please... promise you will
grasp your dream.</font>

118
00:08:35,030 --> 00:08:36,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He too...</font>

119
00:08:38,200 --> 00:08:41,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke also had dreams of his own!</font>

120
00:08:49,960 --> 00:08:53,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank you...
You will become stronger.</font>

121
00:08:55,430 --> 00:08:56,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmm...</font>

122
00:08:56,340 --> 00:08:59,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The super thick fog
has finally begun to clear.</font>

123
00:09:01,770 --> 00:09:03,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There are two over there!</font>

124
00:09:03,350 --> 00:09:04,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They are facing off each other.</font>

125
00:09:04,600 --> 00:09:05,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

126
00:09:06,190 --> 00:09:07,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't see well...</font>

127
00:09:08,560 --> 00:09:10,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Which one is Kakashi-sensei...</font>

128
00:09:11,780 --> 00:09:12,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One moved!</font>

129
00:09:17,360 --> 00:09:18,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

130
00:09:28,420 --> 00:09:30,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Forgive me, Naruto-kun...</font>

131
00:09:38,300 --> 00:09:40,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I cannot die yet!</font>

132
00:09:54,740 --> 00:09:55,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is this the end...?</font>

133
00:10:11,750 --> 00:10:12,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What was that?</font>

134
00:11:10,730 --> 00:11:12,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Zabuza-san...</font>

135
00:11:15,940 --> 00:11:18,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did you say my future
was death?</font>

136
00:11:20,820 --> 00:11:24,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're off the mark again, Kakashi!</font>

137
00:11:29,540 --> 00:11:30,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No...</font>

138
00:11:30,410 --> 00:11:32,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're not to go to the bridge alone!</font>

139
00:11:35,250 --> 00:11:38,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I went all over the town,
but no one wants to come.</font>

140
00:11:39,380 --> 00:11:40,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have no choice!</font>

141
00:11:42,300 --> 00:11:43,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

142
00:11:54,650 --> 00:11:58,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait!
You're just a child!</font>

143
00:11:59,150 --> 00:12:04,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I may be a child, but I already
know what it means to fight.</font>

144
00:12:05,870 --> 00:12:08,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because I'm my father's son!</font>

145
00:12:14,210 --> 00:12:15,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My dear...</font>

146
00:12:18,250 --> 00:12:20,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait a moment, Inari!</font>

147
00:12:28,930 --> 00:12:30,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where did he go...?</font>

148
00:12:32,810 --> 00:12:36,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I didn't notice,
but the fog is starting to lift...</font>

149
00:12:38,190 --> 00:12:39,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? Is he over there?</font>

150
00:12:43,030 --> 00:12:43,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?!</font>

151
00:12:55,750 --> 00:12:58,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What the hell is going on here?!</font>

152
00:13:04,840 --> 00:13:07,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Isn't that the masked boy?</font>

153
00:13:09,180 --> 00:13:11,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I didn't expect him to jump in
to save Zabuza...</font>

154
00:13:18,400 --> 00:13:21,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The boy... is already dead.</font>

155
00:13:26,030 --> 00:13:27,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You did great, Haku.</font>

156
00:13:33,870 --> 00:13:34,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kakashi-sensei!</font>

157
00:13:36,420 --> 00:13:38,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He intends to slash me
along with the boy?!</font>

158
00:13:39,790 --> 00:13:43,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was really a great find I made!</font>

159
00:13:43,800 --> 00:13:45,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even in his final moment,</font>

160
00:13:45,550 --> 00:13:48,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he gave me such
a perfect opportunity!</font>

161
00:13:56,810 --> 00:13:58,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Haku, bad news.</font>

162
00:13:59,940 --> 00:14:02,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have to leave
Land of Water as of tonight.</font>

163
00:14:04,690 --> 00:14:08,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, I'll return
to this land someday.</font>

164
00:14:09,530 --> 00:14:11,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will rule over this land.</font>

165
00:14:12,700 --> 00:14:14,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To do that,</font>

166
00:14:14,580 --> 00:14:19,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">what I need isn't consolation,
encouragement or empty words.</font>

167
00:14:20,080 --> 00:14:21,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What I really need is...</font>

168
00:14:21,960 --> 00:14:23,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I already know.</font>

169
00:14:23,250 --> 00:14:24,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You have nothing to fear.</font>

170
00:14:25,050 --> 00:14:27,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I am your weapon, Zabuza-san.</font>

171
00:14:27,470 --> 00:14:31,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Keep me by you as a mere tool
that heeds your every word.</font>

172
00:14:34,970 --> 00:14:36,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're a good boy!</font>

173
00:14:54,950 --> 00:14:57,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Haku died and you were
able to move, huh?</font>

174
00:14:59,080 --> 00:15:00,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't forgive you!</font>

175
00:15:00,330 --> 00:15:01,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

176
00:15:01,330 --> 00:15:02,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You just stay there and watch!</font>

177
00:15:25,270 --> 00:15:26,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is...</font>

178
00:15:27,570 --> 00:15:29,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">my battle!</font>

179
00:15:34,410 --> 00:15:35,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

180
00:15:36,580 --> 00:15:39,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!
It's good to see you!</font>

181
00:15:41,000 --> 00:15:42,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura-chan...</font>

182
00:15:43,420 --> 00:15:44,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where's Sasuke-kun?</font>

183
00:15:48,420 --> 00:15:51,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!
Where is Sasuke-kun?</font>

184
00:16:01,440 --> 00:16:02,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura...</font>

185
00:16:03,850 --> 00:16:05,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kakashi!</font>

186
00:16:05,270 --> 00:16:07,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You have no time to take
your eyes off me!</font>

187
00:16:11,450 --> 00:16:13,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why don't I go with you?</font>

188
00:16:13,780 --> 00:16:17,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That way, you won't be going
against your Sensei's word.</font>

189
00:16:19,080 --> 00:16:19,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right...</font>

190
00:16:34,180 --> 00:16:35,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke...</font>

191
00:16:42,350 --> 00:16:43,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?!</font>

192
00:17:11,710 --> 00:17:12,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's cold.</font>

193
00:17:13,420 --> 00:17:16,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This isn't Genjutsu, is it?</font>

194
00:17:18,680 --> 00:17:21,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't mind me.</font>

195
00:17:22,430 --> 00:17:25,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This isn't the time to
hold back your emotions...</font>

196
00:17:34,900 --> 00:17:40,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-I always got perfect scores
at the Ninja Academy...</font>

197
00:17:42,740 --> 00:17:43,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

198
00:17:45,250 --> 00:17:48,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I memorized all the
hundreds of Shinobi rules.</font>

199
00:17:49,500 --> 00:17:52,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All the tests were a breeze.</font>

200
00:17:53,590 --> 00:17:56,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Until one day,
this question came up...</font>

201
00:17:59,180 --> 00:18:03,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">State Rule #25 of
the Ways of the Shinobi...</font>

202
00:18:04,350 --> 00:18:08,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As always, I simply wrote down
the answer without batting an eye.</font>

203
00:18:15,030 --> 00:18:17,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"A Shinobi must never
show his true feelings</font>

204
00:18:18,030 --> 00:18:19,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">under any circumstances,
no matter what...</font>

205
00:18:21,070 --> 00:18:22,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The mission always comes first.</font>

206
00:18:23,240 --> 00:18:27,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A Shinobi must have the strength
of character never to shed any tears..."</font>

207
00:18:36,010 --> 00:18:39,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is this... how it must be for a Shinobi?</font>

208
00:18:41,600 --> 00:18:43,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That is so unbearably painful...</font>

209
00:18:45,270 --> 00:18:46,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun...</font>

210
00:19:13,750 --> 00:19:17,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why...?
Why can't I keep up?</font>

211
00:19:20,380 --> 00:19:21,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn you!</font>

212
00:19:39,240 --> 00:19:40,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why you...!</font>

213
00:19:51,210 --> 00:19:53,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You can't possibly defeat me
the way you are now.</font>

214
00:19:54,420 --> 00:19:55,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What was that?</font>

215
00:19:56,460 --> 00:20:01,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You still don't know...
What true strength means!</font>

216
00:20:06,930 --> 00:20:09,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's see how things are going...</font>

217
00:20:16,770 --> 00:20:19,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Goodbye, Demon!</font>

218
00:20:45,640 --> 00:20:48,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Both your arms have
now been disabled.</font>

219
00:20:49,890 --> 00:20:51,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You can't even weave a sign.</font>

220
00:20:55,020 --> 00:20:55,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

221
00:21:00,570 --> 00:21:04,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh!
You really got it this time.</font>

222
00:21:06,990 --> 00:21:09,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You disappoint me, Zabuza.</font>

223
00:21:33,400 --> 00:21:36,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Cultivate your hunger before you idealize.</font></b></font></font></font>

224
00:21:36,780 --> 00:21:40,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Motivate your anger to make them all realize.</font></b></font></font></font>

225
00:21:40,240 --> 00:21:43,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Climbing the mountain, never coming down.</font></b></font></font></font>

226
00:21:43,410 --> 00:21:47,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Break into the contents, never falling down.</font></b></font></font></font>

227
00:21:50,590 --> 00:21:53,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">My knee is still shaking, like I was twelve.</font></b></font></font></font>

228
00:21:53,840 --> 00:21:57,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Sneaking out of the classroom, by the back door.</font></b></font></font></font>

229
00:21:57,180 --> 00:22:00,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">A man railed at me twice though, but I didn't care.</font></b></font></font></font>

230
00:22:00,640 --> 00:22:04,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Waiting is wasting for people like me.</font></b></font></font></font>

231
00:22:04,310 --> 00:22:07,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Don't try to look so wise.</font></b></font></font></font>

232
00:22:07,310 --> 00:22:10,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Don't cry 'cause you're so right.</font></b></font></font></font>

233
00:22:10,770 --> 00:22:14,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Don't dry with fakes or fears,</font></b></font></font></font>

234
00:22:14,360 --> 00:22:17,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">'Cause you will hate yourself in the end.</font></b></font></font></font>

235
00:22:27,330 --> 00:22:30,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#dfe9ed">Don't try to look so wise.</font></b></font></font></font>

236
00:22:30,670 --> 00:22:34,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#dfe9ed">Don't cry 'cause you're so right.</font></b></font></font></font>

237
00:22:34,050 --> 00:22:37,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#dfe9ed">Don't dry with fakes or fears,</font></b></font></font></font>

238
00:22:37,380 --> 00:22:41,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#dfe9ed">'Cause you will hate yourself in the end.</font></b></font></font></font>

239
00:22:41,010 --> 00:22:44,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#dfe9ed">Don't try to look so wise.</font></b></font></font></font>

240
00:22:44,470 --> 00:22:47,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#dfe9ed">Don't cry 'cause you're so right.</font></b></font></font></font>

241
00:22:47,770 --> 00:22:50,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#dfe9ed">Don't dry...</font></b></font></font></font>

242
00:22:53,010 --> 00:22:55,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Huh?! You!</font>

243
00:22:55,310 --> 00:22:57,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">What the hell
are you doing?!</font>

244
00:22:58,180 --> 00:23:00,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Don't you have anything
to say, Zabuza?!</font>

245
00:23:00,770 --> 00:23:02,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">He was your comrade, right?!</font>

246
00:23:02,400 --> 00:23:05,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">You were always,
always together, weren't you?</font>

247
00:23:05,320 --> 00:23:07,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">He really liked you, you know!</font>

248
00:23:08,280 --> 00:23:13,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">You really don't feel anything?!</font>

249
00:23:14,410 --> 00:23:17,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Next Episode:
"Zabuza Disperses Into the Snow...</font>

